<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BOMBAY, NOV 22 - 22 vessels berthed alongside Bombay port. 32 vessels anchored off Bombay floating light awaiting orders. Delay of 3-4 days at JNPT for containers and 9-11 days for bulk cargo.</p>
</text>
